{
  "$comment": "真相源。Linux API → x-kernel (v2 driver model) API 映射。每条 xkernel 接口必须有 source 证据(仓库内路径),check-data 会校验 path 存在。改完跑 make ldp-check-data。",
  "conventions": {
    "dev": "&mut driver_base::Device<'_, PlatformBus>(probe 收到的设备句柄)",
    "ProbeError": "driver_base::ProbeError(probe 失败;含 Deferred 依赖未就绪)",
    "RuntimeError": "driver_base::RuntimeError(运行期错误,枚举:Invalid/NoMemory/Busy/Io/BadState/Unsupported/AlreadyExists/NotFound)",
    "KError": "kerrno::KError(设备类契约方法用,如 RtcDevice::read_time -> KResult)"
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "driver-model",
      "title": "驱动模型与注册",
      "order": 1,
      "rows": [
        {
          "linux": "struct platform_driver + .probe/.remove",
          "xkernel": "`impl DriverOps<PlatformBus> for XxxDriver { type Data; fn probe(&self, dev: &mut Device<'_, PlatformBus>) -> Result<Self::Data, ProbeError>; fn remove }`",
          "note": "Data 即 Linux 的 `struct foo_priv`:probe 里构造并返回,框架持有,remove 原样可变取回,remove 返回后 drop(释放其中所有 RAII guard)",
          "keywords": [
            "platform_driver",
            "probe",
            "remove",
            "DriverOps"
          ],
          "status": "landed",
          "source": {
            "path": "drivers/base/src/driver.rs",
            "line": 15
          }
        },
        {
          "linux": "static const struct of_device_id xxx_of_match[] + .of_match_table",
          "xkernel": "`static IDS: &[PlatformId] = &[PlatformId::Of(OfMatch::compatible(\"vendor,dev\")), PlatformId::Alias(AliasMatch::new(\"alias\"))]`",
          "note": "OfMatch 按 compatible 匹配;AliasMatch 给组合根的 board-static 枚举用",
          "keywords": [
            "of_device_id",
            "of_match_table",
