        {
          "linux": "amba_id / amba_driver（AMBA PrimeCell 总线匹配: `static const struct amba_id`, periphid & mask 比较, module_amba_driver）",
          "xkernel": "`static IDS: &[PlatformId]`（`PlatformId::Of(OfMatch::compatible(\"arm,<dev>\"))` 优先；泛型 `arm,primecell` 节点在 probe 内用 DT 属性 `arm,primecell-periphid` 做掩码比较兜底，不匹配返回 `ProbeError::Fatal` 交给下一个候选驱动）+ `driver_base::declare_driver!`",
          "note": "x-kernel 没有 AMBA 总线层:PrimeCell 设备经 DT 以平台设备枚举,compatible 精确匹配优先,泛型节点靠 `arm,primecell-periphid` 属性自证身份(参考 `references/linux/drivers/amba/bus.c` 的 amba_id 匹配语义与 `include/linux/amba/bus.h`)。参考: rtc-pl031 移植(pl031-qemu)。",
          "keywords": [
            "amba_id",
            "amba_driver",
            "module_amba_driver",
            "amba",
            "primecell",
            "periphid"
          ],
          "status": "landed",
          "source": {
